    {
      "title": "Wikipedia: Star Wars: Episode III \u2013 Revenge of the Sith (video game)",
      "snippet": "[Wikipedia Synopsis] Star Wars: Episode III \u2013 Revenge of the Sith is an action video game based on the 2005 film of the same name. It was released on May 5, 2005, for the PlayStation 2, Xbox, Game Boy Advance, Nintendo DS, and Symbian OS. For the Xbox 360's backwards compatible lineup, Revenge of the Sith is one out of the 400+ backwards compatible games for the 360. As part of the PlayStation 2 classics program, the PlayStation 2 version was re-released in Europe on the PlayStation Network on February 11, 2015, and in North America on April 28, 2015 for PlayStation 3. Additionally, the game can be purchased from the Xbox digital store and played on Xbox One and Xbox Series consoles through the Xbox backwards compatibility program. \nA PlayStation Portable version was in development, but was cancelled. The game received mixed reviews from critics.",
